# Sifat tekshiruvi tartibi (har o‘zgarishdan keyin)

Kichik o‘zgarishdan keyin ham shu tartibda tekshir:

```bash
# 1. Frontend — faqat ERROR'lar (CI gate bilan bir xil)
npm run lint:errors --prefix frontend

# 2. Frontend — tiplar
npm run typecheck --prefix frontend

# 3. Backend — tiplar (build dry)
cd backend && npx tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit

# 4. Fayl hajmi qoidasi (≤400 satr, legacy allowlist bilan)
npm run audit:max-loc
```

Faqat o‘zgartirilgan fayllarni tez tekshirish uchun:

```bash
cd frontend && npx eslint "components/yo‘l/fayl.tsx"     # yoki app/... 
cd backend  && npx tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit          # to‘liq, lekin ~20-40 sek
```

## Qoidalar

- **Yangi kod:** `no-unused-vars`, `prefer-const`, `react/no-unescaped-entities`,
  `@next/next/no-html-link-for-pages`, `react-hooks/rules-of-hooks` — **error**, bajarilishi shart.
- **Legacy pattern:** `react-hooks/set-state-in-effect`, `react-hooks/refs`,
  `react-hooks/exhaustive-deps`, `no-unused-vars` (eski fayllar) — **warning**;
  tegishli ekranni refaktoring qilayotganda tuzat.
- **Ichki havola:** `next/link` (`<Link href="/...">`) ishlatilsa — `<a>` bilan aralashtirmang
  (ochish va yopish tegi mos bo‘lishi kerak).
- **Regex:** regex ichida faqat zarur escape qoldiriladi — `[\s_-]`, `[\\/]`.
  Boshqaruv belgilari (`\x00-\x1F`) ataylab ishlatilsa, sabab bilan
  `// eslint-disable-next-line no-control-regex -- izoh` yoziladi.
- **Format:** faylni qo‘lda qayta formatlamang; `npm run format:write` (ildizda) yoki
  Cursor’da "Format Document" (Prettier) ishlatiladi. Kod uslubi: 2 bo‘sh joy, qo‘sh tirnoq,
  `;` bilan, `trailingComma: none`, `endOfLine: auto` (CRLF fayllarni buzmaydi).
- **Commit oldidan:** `backend/.husky/pre-commit` typecheck + `audit:max-loc` ni bajaradi;
  u yiqilsa commit bo‘lmaydi.

## Buyruqlar (Cursor’da tez ishlatish uchun)

| Maqsad | Buyruq |
|--------|--------|
| Frontend error’lar | `npm run lint:errors --prefix frontend` |
| Frontend hammasi | `npm run lint --prefix frontend` |
| Frontend auto-fix | `npm run lint:fix --prefix frontend` |
| Frontend typecheck | `npm run typecheck --prefix frontend` |
| Frontend testlar | `npm run test --prefix frontend` |
| Backend typecheck | `cd backend && npx tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit` |
| Backend testlar | `npm run test:ci --prefix backend` |
| Fayl hajmi audit | `npm run audit:max-loc` |
| Format tekshirish | `npm run format:check` |
| Format yozish | `npm run format:write` |

> Eslatma: `lint` uchun `frontend/node_modules` o‘rnatilgan bo‘lishi kerak (`npm ci --prefix frontend`).
> Backendda ESLint konfiguratsiyasi yo‘q — backend uchun gate `tsc --noEmit` + Vitest.
